AGB-RA is provided for building a Nintendo 3DS homebrew GBA emulator.

- AGB-RA frontend (source/, include/, Makefile): MIT
- rcheevos (third_party/rcheevos): MIT, RetroAchievements.org
- mGBA (fetched by fetch-deps.sh): MPL-2.0, Jeffrey Pfau (endrift)

Linking mGBA makes the resulting binary subject to the MPL-2.0 for the
mGBA portions. Do not include copyrighted Game Boy Advance BIOS or ROMs
in distributions.

